  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Inside Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, Mo Yao urges Fang Yuan to use the wisdom path Gu he has been buying. She names special will Gu with deliberate will Gu, play will Gu, keep will Gu, and new will Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          598
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
          "char_mo_yao",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_deliberate_will_gu",
          "gu_play_will_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Among eight wisdom path Gu that can produce wills, special will Gu produces special wills and can only be activated under special circumstances. The same Gu can also devour special wills. Fang Yuan chooses it, injects primeval essence, and a will forms that looks like him, a youth with dark eyes and a more decisive face. He sends that will into a rank two big soul worm so it can enter a true inheritance light lump and return with the contents.",
        "chapters": [
          598
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When a strand of Giant Sun’s will enters Fang Yuan’s mind through a glass owner token, he activates special will Gu. It blocks that golden will and then swallows it. Mo Yao recognizes Giant Sun’s will as a special will. Special will can be arranged in advance and triggered under set conditions. Giant Sun Immortal Venerable used special will Gu to leave a will of himself in Eighty-Eight True Yang Building. A special will is restrained by the matching Gu, so Fang Yuan’s copy can devour that strand even though an Immortal Venerable’s will is still dangerous in larger amount.",
        "chapters": [
          607
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "giant-suns-will",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_special_will",
          "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Special wills differ from other wills: the Gu Master can give a special command that triggers if specific circumstances are met. Giant Sun’s will was given a resolve to kill an otherworldly demon if one was found.",
        "chapters": [
          614
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "kill-command",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
